  "objectives": [
    "Their outpost is north-east, behind a Lotus turret.",
    "The wrecks in the middle of the map can be reclaimed for metal.",
    "One of their Glaives patrols away from the outpost. Time it."
  ],
  "briefing": "A scouting party went north-east and did not come back.\n\nWhat is out there is small - a commander, two Glaives and a Lotus turret around a solar collector. Small is not nothing: walk your own commander into that turret and this is a short mission. One of their Glaives walks a beat towards the middle of the map, so the approach is not always watched.\n\nYou have three Glaives, a solar collector and a metal extractor. There are wrecks in the middle worth reclaiming on the way through.\n\nKill their commander. Keep yours.\n\nOn Hard there is a second turret.",
